# FIGlet fonts are vendored data, not source: public/figlet/PROVENANCE.txt and
# src/lib/ascii/fonts.json record a SHA-256 of each file AS SHIPPED, and
# src/lib/ascii/provenance.test.ts re-checks it. They are pure text, so git
# would otherwise autodetect them as text and rewrite their line endings on
# checkout under core.autocrlf — every checksum would fail on a fresh clone
# on Windows, and the bytes the app serves would not be the bytes we vouched
# for. Stored and checked out verbatim.
*.flf -text
